-- Companion file to trade_lifecycle_record.le, for its export to Daml
-- (File > Export to Another System > Daml): what trade_lifecycle_record.lps
-- gives LPS in Prolog, here in Daml, named after the predicate and the
-- places a rule knows when it asks it (b, known).

-- date_later(Later, Earlier)
dateLater_bb : Date -> Date -> Bool
dateLater_bb later earlier = later > earlier
